{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":177,"count":29,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L11-3-14\",\"机会\",\"機會\",\"机会\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我有一些台灣朋友，所以說中文的機會很多。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu yìxiē Táiwān péngyǒu, suǒyǐ shuō Zhōngwén de jīhuì hěn duō.","english":"I have some Taiwanese friends, so I have many chances to speak Chinese.","sourceCardId":"B1L11-3-14","sourceFront":"機會","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:你覺得我可以當老師嗎？ B:如果你想當，一定有機會。","pinyin":"A: Nǐ juéde wǒ kěyǐ dāng lǎoshī ma? B: Rúguǒ nǐ xiǎng dāng, yídìng yǒu jīhuì.","english":"A: Do you think I can be a teacher? B: If you want to be one, you'll definitely have a chance.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-1-04","sourceFront":"當","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我還沒去過日本，今年可能有機會去。","pinyin":"Wǒ hái méi qù guo Rìběn, jīnnián kěnéng yǒu jīhuì qù.","english":"I have not yet been to Japan; this year I might have a chance to go.","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-07","sourceFront":"過","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他跑得很快，如果跟他比賽，我沒有機會贏，一定會輸。","pinyin":"Tā pǎo de hěn kuài, rúguǒ gēn tā bǐsài, wǒ méiyǒu jīhuì yíng, yīdìng huì shū.","english":"He runs very fast; if I compete with him, I have no chance of winning—I will definitely lose.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-08","sourceFront":"輸","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的成績很好，有機會得到出國留學的獎學金。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-13","sourceFront":"得到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加社團活動，是讓自己成長的好機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-23","sourceFront":"成長","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個週末以前，超過三千塊錢的東西都可以打九折，請把握機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-27","sourceFront":"把握","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王先生這輩子沒結婚，他希望下輩子會有機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-11","sourceFront":"輩子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有些人等待了一輩子，都等不到高升的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-14","sourceFront":"等待","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國留學有很多好處，除了學習語言，還有文化交流的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-23","sourceFront":"交流","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"雖然陸先生這幾年工作機會不斷，但是因為身體不好的關係一直沒辦法去上班。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-13","sourceFront":"不斷","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家廣告公司提供了五個工作機會，只要是設計系畢業的都可以去試試看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-07","sourceFront":"提供","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"來來來，快來買！我們3C產品的價格最優惠，品質也很好，快把握機會喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-13","sourceFront":"優惠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一份研究報告表示，對陌生環境適應能力越強的人，未來成功的機會也越高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-18","sourceFront":"陌生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，收到禮物的人要找機會回禮，表達自己的感謝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-24","sourceFront":"回","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"機會來了就應該好好把握，不然就太可惜了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-20","sourceFront":"不然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們大學前年起已開放跨校選課，增加各校的交流機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-27","sourceFront":"跨","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"完全按照別人的話來工作，是很省事沒錯，卻失去了讓自己進步的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-42","sourceFront":"省事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有好的投資機會就該好好掌握，不要等到事後才開始後悔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-21","sourceFront":"等到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"碰到困難無法繼續前進時，暫時後退等待機會也是一種作法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-21","sourceFront":"後退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"觀光客都說日本四季的景色都很有特色，有機會我要親自去體驗一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-32","sourceFront":"體驗","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"談生意時千萬別打斷客戶的話，不然做生意的機會很可能就斷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-46","sourceFront":"斷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"水災過後應立刻打掃環境，才能降低傳染病流行的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-03","sourceFront":"傳染病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"隨著空氣被汙染的情況越來越嚴重，得到癌症的機會也增加了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-20","sourceFront":"癌症","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有能力的人就算不幸失業了，將來還是有許多機會等待著他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-06","sourceFront":"失業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他因為生活條件的限制，而放棄了出國留學的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-04","sourceFront":"放棄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"設計師利用上電視的機會，展示他今年設計的服裝。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-06","sourceFront":"展示","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"政府建公立學校的目的，主要是提高人民接受教育的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-07","sourceFront":"公立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加廚師比賽，只要味道部分的分數很高，就有機會得獎。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-34","sourceFront":"得獎","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家工廠奪下了著名品牌產品的製造機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-03","sourceFront":"奪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-10\",\"书桌\",\"書桌\",\"书桌\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"路旁有很多小白花，我常常摘一些放在書桌上，看著看著心情就愉快了","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-23","sourceFront":"摘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想在床旁邊擺個書桌，不過空間不太夠，你可以幫我把床移到牆邊嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-28","sourceFront":"移","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-1-15\",\"雲\",\"雲\",\"云\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"雲小姐最近突然開始化妝了，人也變美了。大家都猜她戀愛了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-14","sourceFront":"猜","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的會議資料都存在雲端，這樣又安全又方便，各部門也能隨時參考。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-01","sourceFront":"雲端","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的會議資料我已經上傳到雲端，請各位開會前先了解要討論的內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-23","sourceFront":"上傳","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師先把跟課程相關的學習資料上傳到雲端，讓學生預習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-27","sourceFront":"預習","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸虧我把資料都存在雲端，要不然找不到隨身碟，怎麼開會呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-29","sourceFront":"幸虧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於雲端科技的進步，人類的生活方式跟以往比起來有很大的差異。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-07","sourceFront":"由於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在雲端科技發達的時代裡，人人都能夠透過網路交友、學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-23","sourceFront":"發達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"太太：要是你閒著沒事，就幫我泡一壺熱茶吧。先生：我哪裡閒？我馬上要開雲端會議了，可是忙得很呢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-16","sourceFront":"閒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Before pouring down sheets of 雨(rain), vapor swirls like rolling 云(cloud mist) to form a dense 雲(cloud)."},{"key":"[\"B2L09-1-09\",\"口試\",\"口試\",\"口试\",\"N/Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我上次口試的時候太緊張，所以沒聽懂老師問的問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-09","sourceFront":"口試","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"下星期一有課堂小考和口試，我得好好準備。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-07","sourceFront":"課堂","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"今天中文口試時我太緊張了，一時不知道怎麼回答，所以成績不太好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-42","sourceFront":"一時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師說這次口試的題目不難，回答是只要放輕鬆、別緊張，就沒問題了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-34","sourceFront":"放輕鬆","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-04\",\"摊子\",\"攤子\",\"摊子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在路邊的攤子享受小吃，得注意他們處理食物的方式衛不衛生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-28","sourceFront":"衛生","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-19\",\"服务\",\"服務\",\"服务\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我參加了愛心服務社以後，想法比以前更成熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"愛心服務社把社員的愛心聚在一起，到安養院去幫助老人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-15","sourceFront":"聚","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的服務生對客人很親切，讓客人都吃得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-29","sourceFront":"親切","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多大學生參加愛心服務的社團，幫助老人打掃環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-09","sourceFront":"許多","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利商店的服務有賣票、收電話費和水電費等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-02","sourceFront":"服務","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位服務生不笑的時候，樣子看起來很兇，其實他對客人的態度很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-25","sourceFront":"凶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要吸引顧客來購買價格高的商品，除了品質好，服務態度也很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-34","sourceFront":"購買","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳不僅服務態度好，而且食物好吃又便宜，難怪大家都推薦我來嚐嚐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-03","sourceFront":"不僅","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個活動會場有服務中心，想找人的話，可以請服務人員廣播。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-27","sourceFront":"廣播","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A: 現在的科技提供非常好用的網路服務，而且很多都是免費的。 B: 好用倒是好用，可是萬一沒有網路，就什麼都做不了了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-05","sourceFront":"倒是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他參加了服務社團的活動後，生活比過去更豐富、更有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-28","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個國家公園的服務中心提供遊客簡介，介紹公園的特色和有名的景點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-03","sourceFront":"簡介","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為店員的服務態度很好，所以這個專櫃的銷售成績是最好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-12","sourceFront":"銷售","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家電腦公司本來只服務亞洲地區的民眾，現在服務範圍已經擴大到歐洲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-28","sourceFront":"範圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學生與校長當面對話，希望學校改善教學設備和校園餐廳的服務品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3