CardId":"B3L06-1-39","sourceFront":"既然","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"夏天一到，這個海灘上就會看到許多人帶著衝浪板來衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-28","sourceFront":"衝浪板","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個週末我過得很充實，不但完成了期末報告，還跟同學去游泳、衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-07","sourceFront":"充實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像衝浪、滑雪那樣的戶外活動，又刺激又好玩，不用說，絕對能吸引青少年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-08","sourceFront":"不用說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"報名衝浪課的手續很簡單，只要到辦公室填一張基本資料表就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-28","sourceFront":"表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天海邊的浪不大，不適合去衝浪。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-02","sourceFront":"浪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-10\",\"無關\",\"無關\",\"无关\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:聽說明天的會跟新商品的推銷計畫有關，你要參加嗎？ B:我是公司的安全人員，這個會應該跟我無關。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-10","sourceFront":"無關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"能不能騎自行車完成環島的行程，跟耐心有關，跟聰明不聰明無關。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-09","sourceFront":"有關","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"Having 無(no) trace of 關(lock up): 無關 means unrelated."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-2-04\",\"堅強\",\"堅強\",\"坚强\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"父母不能保護孩子一輩子，得讓他們自己經驗一些挫折，才能培養出堅強的性格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-04","sourceFront":"堅強","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 堅(hard) and 強(strong): 堅強 means mentally strong."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-04\",\"骗\",\"騙\",\"骗\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他把所有的錢都給了女朋友，直到女朋友被警察抓了，才知道自己被騙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-04","sourceFront":"騙","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那個老闆做生意不老實，一再跟客人保證商品沒問題，其實是騙人的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-08","sourceFront":"老實","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"有個騙子吃完了麵，假裝忘記帶錢包，騙老闆要回家拿錢，一離開就沒回來了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-06","sourceFront":"假裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"跟大人比起來，小孩子的想法比較單純、天真，不會故意騙人","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-10","sourceFront":"天真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:網友跟我借十萬塊錢，說他的家人生病住院了。 B:你太天真了，他是騙你的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-10","sourceFront":"天真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:你說老闆下個月要提高每個人的薪水，沒騙我吧？ B:這個消息是從他的口中說出來的，當然是真的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-34","sourceFront":"口","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要求孩子不論在任何情況都不許騙人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-16","sourceFront":"不許","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-14\",\"身边\",\"身邊\",\"身边\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"華人在除夕那天，都要回到父母身邊，全家聚在一起吃年夜飯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-14","sourceFront":"身邊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"對我來說，幸福就是在身邊有一群願意互相幫助的好友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-38","sourceFront":"群","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自殺或許能令個人不再受到痛苦，但卻把痛苦留給了身邊的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-04","sourceFront":"自殺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們應該培養獨立思考的能力，別被身邊各種訊息左右。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-23","sourceFront":"左右","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"嬰兒學說話時，身邊的人說什麼，他們就會照著說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-09","sourceFront":"嬰兒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-16\",\"积极\",\"積極\",\"积极\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"古小姐做事的態度很積極，為了完成任務，總是很早就做好計畫，而且立刻實行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-16","sourceFront":"積極","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了提高這座城市的文化水準，市長積極建設藝術表演中心、圖書館等公共空間","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-21","sourceFront":"建設","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這幾年由於市長積極實行交通建設計畫，使當地交通情況明顯改善了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-24","sourceFront":"明顯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他願意挑戰自己的工作能力，並積極地克服挫折，真是難得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-04","sourceFront":"難得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我爸爸認為我們這一代做事不夠積極，缺少耐心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-03","sourceFront":"代","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"樂觀的人會積極挑戰困難，就算無法成功也不會感到失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-24","sourceFront":"感到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-04\",\"令\",\"令\",\"令\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"當鄰居生活遇到困難時，老馬總是主動提供協助，真令人感動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-04","sourceFront":"令","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"聽見他欣賞的那位歌星來演唱的消息，令他興奮地跳了起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-38","sourceFront":"演唱","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"所有令人傷腦筋的過程，都是為了使自己變成腦筋很好的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-40","sourceFront":"腦筋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果從事某項工作能令你忘掉時間，或許就可當作一生的事業。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-26","sourceFront":"從事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"路教授最近發表的這套跟人體大腦有關的理論，令其他科學家很感興趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-45","sourceFront":"套","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自殺或許能令個人不再受到痛苦，但卻把痛苦留給了身邊的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-04","sourceFront":"自殺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本地社區的房子常被好奇的觀光客破壞，令人們十分不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-09","sourceFront":"好奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在處理那位顧客的問題上，餐廳的態度真令我失望。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-30","sourceFront":"失望","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在古代，國王所說的話是絕對的，也是最高的命令。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-34","sourceFront":"命令","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"接觸陌生的事情及環境時，往往令人有點兒不安，這樣的感覺是很自然的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-25","sourceFront":"不安","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他與妻子雖然已結婚多年，感情仍維持得很好，真令人羨慕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-21","sourceFront":"妻子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"生命中每一刻都很珍貴，隨時多用點心、多付出，就能令人生更美好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-08","sourceFront":"刻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A leader calls to 亼(gather) subjects while a 龴(seal) stamps the official decree to prompt action → 令(cause)."},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-17\",\"茶葉\",\"茶葉\",\"茶叶\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"茶樹的葉子沒有被破壞的話，做出來的茶葉品質都比較好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-18","sourceFront":"葉子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"他用很珍貴的茶具來泡品質很普通的茶葉，真浪費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-07","sourceFront":"普通","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從採用專家提供的方法後，茶葉的產量已增加百分之五十。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-10","sourceFront":"產量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-1-32\",\"考虑\",\"考慮\",\"考虑\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我考慮接受公司的安排，到國外協助市場調查工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-32","sourceFront":"考慮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"當你大學畢業，不再升學時，就得考慮就業問題了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-05","sourceFront":"就業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購買任何商品時都應考慮功能以及價格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-26","sourceFront":"以及","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-09\",\"熟練\",\"熟練\",\"熟练\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她在電子工廠上班，難怪拆機器的技術非常熟練。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-09","sourceFront":"熟練","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"擲標槍、射箭、開槍(to shoot)需要的技巧都不同，想熟練就得多連練習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-06","sourceFront":"槍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"依\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 亻(person) leans on a 衣(cloth) for support, trusting it to hold them up → 依(rely on)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"喝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) wonders 曷(where) the water went → 喝(drink)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"枝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 木(tree) leans on a 支(support) to hold up one 枝(branch)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"條\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) takes a light 攵(rap) to the 木(tree), stripping a branch → one 條(measure word for roads)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"比較\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"比(compare) + 較(compare) → comparing gives the relative measure: 比較 means relatively."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"溝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Directing fresh 氵(water) through an interlocking 冓(crossbeam) aqueduct drains fields into a clear 溝(ditch)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"貝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"An 目(eye) peeks out of a shell, and 八(eight) little legs wiggle below it — a hermit crab in its 貝(sea shell)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"體會\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 體(body) and 會(meet): 體會 means realize."}]}
